Changes made in this copy:
- generate_review.py: render .html outputs live in an iframe instead of as
  source text.
- generate_review.py: escape "</" in the embedded JSON so output files that
  contain </script> cannot close the viewer's script tag.
- generate_review.py: also look for eval_metadata.json two directories above a
  run (eval-N/<config>/run-N/ layout).
- viewer.html: taller iframe for rendered pages (85vh).
